OL,3,GNEWSANew section of path in South Downs
OL,4,Aopens to public
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new section of a path through the
OL,7,FSouth Downs has opened to the public.
OL,9,FThe Centurion Way passes through
OL,10,FWellhanger Copse and provides a link to
OL,11,Fthe Drovers bus stop on the A286.
OL,13,FIt means walkers, runners, and cyclists
OL,14,Fcan travel all the way from Chichester
OL,15,Finto the centre of the National Park.
OL,17,FA further small section north,
OL,18,Falongside a new bridge, is due to be
OL,19,Ffinished in the coming weeks and will
OL,20,Fextend the route to Littlewood.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
